              <span style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #059669; border: 1px solid #10B981; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">
